// arXiv source page 2
#original-page(612pt, 792pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(516.425pt, 719.76pt, "2 ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 92.88pt, "Abstract ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 116.4pt, "Modern autonomous systems are driving the critical need for the next-generation of adaptive ")
  #line-at(90pt, 127.92pt, "materials and structures with embodied intelligence, i.e., the embodiment of memory, perception, ")
  #line-at(90pt, 139.44pt, "learning, and decision-making within the mechanical domain. A fundamental challenge is the ")
  #line-at(90pt, 150.96pt, "seamless and efficient integration of memory with information processing in a physically ")
  #line-at(90pt, 162.48pt, "interpretable way that enables cognitive learning and decision-making under uncertainty. Prevailing ")
  #line-at(90pt, 174pt, "paradigms, from intricate logic cascades to black-box morphological computing or physical neural ")
  #line-at(90pt, 185.52pt, "networks, are seriously limited by trade-offs among efficiency, scalability, interpretability, ")
  #line-at(90pt, 197.04pt, "transparency, and the reliance on additional electronics. Here, we introduce in-memory phononic ")
  #line-at(90pt, 208.56pt, "learning, a paradigm-shifting framework that unifies non-volatile mechanical memory with wave-")
  #line-at(90pt, 220.08pt, "dynamics-based perception within a phononic metastructure. Our system encodes spatial ")
  #line-at(90pt, 231.36pt, "information into stable structural states as mechanical memory that directly programs its elastic ")
  #line-at(90pt, 242.88pt, "wave-propagation landscape. This memory/wave-dynamics coupling enables effective sensory ")
  #line-at(90pt, 254.4pt, "perception, decomposing complex patterns into informative geometric features through frequency-")
  #line-at(90pt, 265.92pt, "selective wave localization. Learning is created by optimizing input waveforms to selectively probe ")
  #line-at(90pt, 277.44pt, "these features for memory-pattern classification, with decisions inferred directly from the output ")
  #line-at(90pt, 288.96pt, "wave energy, thereby completing the entire information loop mechanically through an efficient and ")
  #line-at(90pt, 300.48pt, "physically transparent mechanism without hidden architectures or electronics. We experimentally ")
  #line-at(90pt, 312pt, "and numerically investigated exemplar high-accuracy classification across diverse tasks, from ")
  #line-at(90pt, 323.52pt, "geometric shapes to handwritten digits. This work transcends the paradigm of \"materials that ")
  #line-at(90pt, 335.04pt, "compute\" to “cognitive matter” capable of interpreting the dynamic environments, paving the way ")
  #line-at(90pt, 346.56pt, "for future intelligent structural-material systems with low power consumption, more direct interaction ")
  #line-at(90pt, 358.08pt, "with surroundings, and enhanced cybersecurity and resilience in harsh conditions. ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 384pt, "Keywords: ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(143.901pt, 384pt, "mechanical intelligence | phononic learning | non-volatile mechanical memory | ")
  #line-at(90pt, 395.52pt, "multistable metastructure | wave-based computing")
]

