#original-page(612pt, 792pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(510.85pt, 719.76pt, "14 ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 90.96pt, "advantage over conventional morphological approaches that often require laborious, task-specific ")
  #line-at(90pt, 102.48pt, "structural optimization and reconfiguration across different tasks. Furthermore, it demonstrates a ")
  #line-at(90pt, 114pt, "more efficient pathway to scale computational complexity. Conventional morphological systems  ")
  #line-at(90pt, 125.52pt, "typically sequentially cascade multiple physical layers to enrich computing power, which increases ")
  #line-at(90pt, 137.04pt, "architectural complexity and can compromise efficiency. In contrast, our framework scales within a ")
  #line-at(90pt, 148.56pt, "single metastructure substrate by leveraging a richer set of frequency components. This essentially ")
  #line-at(90pt, 160.08pt, "creates a high number of parallel, hidden layers in the frequency domain, where different frequency ")
  #line-at(90pt, 171.36pt, "bands simultaneously extract diverse features. This inherent parallelism allows our system to ")
  #line-at(90pt, 182.88pt, "handle more complex tasks like digit recognition without sacrificing its streamlined, single-layer ")
  #line-at(90pt, 194.4pt, "architecture, while achieving high accuracy. ")
  #line-at(90pt, 217.44pt, "To further assess the information processing capacity of our platform, we extend the ‘0’/‘1’ ")
  #line-at(90pt, 228.96pt, "handwritten digit classification tasks to a 14-by-14 metastructure in simulation. With increased ")
  #line-at(90pt, 240.48pt, "spatial resolution and a larger dataset with 900 training and 100 testing samples per digit, the ")
  #line-at(90pt, 252pt, "performance improves with reduced overfitting, achieving a training accuracy of 95.1% and testing ")
  #line-at(90pt, 263.52pt, "accuracy of 96.0% (see Supporting Information, Section S9 for more details of handwritten digit ")
  #line-at(90pt, 275.04pt, "recognition on a 14-by-14 metastructure). We then challenge the system with a full 10-class digit ")
  #line-at(90pt, 286.56pt, "recognition task. For this highly complex task, we focus on highlighting the computing potential of ")
  #line-at(90pt, 297.84pt, "the wave-based feature perception capability by employing a hybrid setup, where the frequency ")
  #line-at(90pt, 309.36pt, "response serves as a fixed physical reservoir to perceive input pattern features, and for each ")
  #line-at(90pt, 320.88pt, "harmonic excitation, the full spatial phononic wavefield is readout and concatenated as a feature ")
  #line-at(90pt, 332.4pt, "vector. A linear readout layer is then trained to classify the resulting high-dimensional feature ")
  #line-at(90pt, 343.92pt, "vectors. With 9000 training and 1000 testing samples, this setup achieves 96% testing accuracy, ")
  #line-at(90pt, 355.44pt, "demonstrating that the phononic feature space perceived by the metastructure is sufficiently rich ")
  #line-at(90pt, 366.96pt, "and discriminative for state-of-the-art tasks (see Supporting Information, Section S9 for more ")
  #line-at(90pt, 378.48pt, "details of the 10-class handwritten digit recognition task). ")
  #line-at(90pt, 399.84pt, "The results from the two exemplar tasks collectively demonstrate that our in-memory phononic ")
  #line-at(90pt, 411.36pt, "learning framework successfully leverages the rich wave physics of structured media to achieve ")
  #line-at(90pt, 422.88pt, "machine-learning classification tasks directly in the mechanical domain in an efficient and physically ")
  #line-at(90pt, 434.4pt, "interpretable manner. More specifically, by programming wave-memory interactions in a single ")
  #line-at(90pt, 445.92pt, "metastructure, we enable a form of mechanical cognition, where the material itself can store and ")
  #line-at(90pt, 457.44pt, "perceive information, learn from knowledge, and make decisions autonomously. This approach ")
  #line-at(90pt, 468.96pt, "clearly establishes a new paradigm for creating intelligent matters capable of adaptive reasoning ")
  #line-at(90pt, 480.48pt, "and learning through their inherent physical properties.  ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 501.84pt, "Discussion  ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90pt, 524.88pt, "In summary, we present an efficient, unified and physically transparent framework for advancing ")
  #line-at(90pt, 536.4pt, "the state of the art of mechanical intelligence – embodying ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(368.736pt, 536.4pt, "in-memory phononic learning")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.08pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(501.296pt, 536.4pt, " into ")
  #line-at(90pt, 547.92pt, "architected materials that enables memory, perception, and learning capabilities, and investigate ")
  #line-at(90pt, 559.44pt, "its efficacy in and through a rationally designed phononic metastructure. By coupling non-volatile ")
  #line-at(90pt, 570.96pt, "mechanical memory with wave-based information processing, we enable mechanical learning by ")
  #line-at(90pt, 582.48pt, "harnessing memory-state-dependent wave dynamics as a physical analog neural network. It ")
  #line-at(90pt, 594pt, "achieves effective feature-level perception through interpretable wave-localization modes and ")
  #line-at(90pt, 605.52pt, "implements cognitive memory-pattern classification via trainable input waveforms, completing the ")
  #line-at(90pt, 617.04pt, "entire process—from information encoding to perceptual feature extraction to learned decision—")
  #line-at(90pt, 628.32pt, "all within the mechanical domain. Utilizing example testbeds, our experimental and numerical ")
  #line-at(90pt, 639.84pt, "validation demonstrates the framework's effectiveness, where the same metastructure achieves ")
  #line-at(90pt, 651.36pt, "high accuracy in classifying geometric shapes and handwritten digits, with multi-tasking capability ")
  #line-at(90pt, 662.88pt, "enabled simply by updating the input waveforms. This approach overcomes key limitations in the ")
  #line-at(90pt, 674.4pt, "state-of-the-art mechanical intelligence. First, it provides physical transparency—unlike black-box ")
  #line-at(90pt, 685.92pt, "morphological systems, the learned mappings are directly traceable to physics-grounded phononic ")
  #line-at(90pt, 697.44pt, "property tailoring. Second, it offers high efficiency through phononic parallel processing across ")
]

